  "description_text": "Set in San Franciscos Hunters Point Shipyard, this fantastic value awaits with a three-level townhome that pairs clean architectural lines with inviting indoor and outdoor spaces. Private street-level entry sits beside the frosted-glass garage door, with parking and storage at ground level. On the main living level, dark wood floors and recessed lighting connect the open living and dining areas to a kitchen with white cabinetry, quartz countertops, a mosaic tile backsplash, stainless steel appliances, a gas range, and an island. Upstairs, the bedrooms and baths include a tub and a glass-enclosed shower with tile accents. A fenced rear yard with patio offers room to relax or entertain. Neighborhood parks and open space add to the setting, with access to Dogpatch, Chase Center, Third Street Muni service, and Highways 101 and 280.",
