  "description_text": "Transparent Pricing! This move-in ready, must-see, stylish, townhome delivers elevated design with a playful edge. With no neighbors above or below, this townhouse lives like a single family home and includes the rare luxury of an attached, side-by-side two car garage. The open concept living space is made for entertaining, featuring elegant laminated floors throughout and a seamless flow into a designer kitchen that steals the show. The oversized 8+foot quartz island invites everything from casual breakfasts to cocktail hour conversations, while sleek stainless steel appliances add a polished, modern finish. Upstairs, you'll find two generously sized bedrooms, including a serene primary suite with an ensuite bath, your own personal escape. Laundry day is a snap with a washer and dryer conveniently located upstairs. Step outside to your private patio backyard, perfect for morning coffee, weekend gatherings, or unwinding after a long day. Just beyond your front door, take in breathtaking bay views and enjoy resort-style community amenities including a BBQ and picnic area, playground, greenbelt, and scenic walking trail overlooking the bay. Located just blocks from the newly opened India Basin Waterfront Park, with its trails and food pavilion, and offering easy access to dining, shopping, downtown commutes, and world-class entertainment at Chase Center and Oracle Park, this home delivers the ultimate urban lifestyle without compromise. Lender Paid Assistance program of up to $7500 towards closing costs available to qualified buyers. Call for details! *SOME PHOTOS ARE VIRTUALLY STAGED*",
